- Astra’s **four agreed failures** were one memory decline and three H20 declines. Hugging Face was recovered in all three Astra draws; it is useful as a control, not an Astra failure to recover. [Astra results](</Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-6/astra/RESULT.md>), [complementary results](</Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-6/astra/RESULT-REST.md>)
