- Treat this selected, previously exposed sample as a **diagnostic**, not evidence sufficient by itself to name a production leader. Pre-register topic-level refusal and material-harm comparisons, controls, and an inconclusive outcome. Confirm the $3 cap reserves retries and in-flight calls within the remaining D439 ceiling.

The $0 preparation should include the whole-request blind audit, exact request comparison, control and failure-path tests, and preflight. A paid send requires a separate decision on the prepared design; the frozen ruler and D426 remain unchanged.

CONSENSUS: open a $0 design review of Astra with A2, with the comparative and harm criteria corrected first.
